  "title": "Permian Resources Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call",
  "summary": "MIDLAND, Texas – Permian Resources Corporation (“Permian Resources” or the “Company”) (NYSE: PR) announced today that it will report second quarter 2026 financial and operating results after the market closes for trading on Wednesday, August 5, 2026. Management will host an earnings conference call on Thursday, August 6, 2026, at 9:00 a.m. Central (10:00 a.m. […]",
